    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remnants of Lumira is a fast paced story-based 3D platformer with a retro aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a mouse named &quot;Furvolt&quot; unaware of your sense of time, but desperate to find answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanding move set as the story progresses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Unique Worlds with their own series of levels and aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging platforming gameplay accommodating for the casual 3d platforming fan, to the most seasoned veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret/multiple endings(?!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a series of levels within 5 Worlds, where you unlock new abilities to better circumnavigate your environments, while also progressing through the story and unlocking new characters throughout your journey!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remnants of Lumira is a fast paced story-based 3D platformer with a retro aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a mouse named &quot;Furvolt&quot; unaware of your sense of time, but desperate to find answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanding move set as the story progresses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Unique Worlds with their own series of levels and aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging platforming gameplay accommodating for the casual 3d platforming fan, to the most seasoned veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret/multiple endings(?!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a series of levels within 5 Worlds, where you unlock new abilities to better circumnavigate your environments, while also progressing through the story and unlocking new characters throughout your journey!</p>",
    "short_description": "An open ended 3D Platformer, with retro graphics, and an expanding moveset. Features 5+ different playable characters across 5 different worlds with a story to complement the route of progression. Geared for both casual and veteran fans of the genre.",
